# C++ game code: run `haxe build-cpp.hxml` before VS when linking libMain.lib (see Readme.md → «For library users»).
-cp src
-cp gamecpp
# Mirror hxdefold-style recursive includes (two lines; comma in one line breaks Windows hxml).
--macro include("", true, null, ["src"])
--macro include("", true, null, ["gamecpp"])
-main gamecpp.Main
-cpp ../HxCppOut
-dce full
-D analyzer-optimize
-D hxwerks_cpp
# Embed in game exe: libMain.lib + real HxwerksCppBridge.cpp (no stub); run `haxe build-cpp.hxml` before VS build.
-D hxwerks_embed
-D static_link
# Match Leadwerks game project (x64); required or libMain.lib is x86 and link fails.
-D HXCPP_M64
# Dynamic CRT /MD (MultiThreadedDLL) — same family as typical VS Release. Passed to hxcpp *before* toolchain (fixes LNK2038 vs /MT).
-D ABI=-MD
